rica for the first time since 1993. There is concern Rwanda are using it as another sportswashing opportunity, but there is also hope the event's legacy can impact wider African society.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>South Sudan's road to elections remains uncertain</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a2f09c0afacb8321ae29dbd6f760cd125010a9c28556e0c41b65b3a4ea1a5a98</id><updated>2026-10-16T13:21:23Z</updated><published>2026-10-08T04:20:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/south-sudan-s-road-to-elections-remains-uncertain/a-79563442--6016ef79f3a9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/south-sudan-s-road-to-elections-remains-uncertain/a-79563442?maca=en-rss-en-africa-8291-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">South Sudan's first general election is set for December 22. Insecurity, political tensions and the failure to begin voter registration have raised doubts over whether a credible poll can be held.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Anthropic report: Is Russia using AI for disinformation in the Central African Republic and elsewhere across Africa?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:735d473d877d87701f83407f108df0e63df8216b7eccc8c86cc6e55571ca4725</id><updated>2026-10-16T13:21:23Z</updated><published>2026-10-04T17:15:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/anthropic-report-is-russia-using-ai-for-disinformation-in-the-central-african-republic-and-elsewhere/a-79476947--316a6e450389.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/anthropic-report-is-russia-using-ai-for-disinformation-in-the-central-african-republic-and-elsewhere-across-africa/a-79476947?maca=en-rss-en-africa-8291-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">An Anthropic report says the AI model Claude was used in pro-Russian campaigns in the Central African Republic. Similar allegations were raised for the Democratic Republic of the Congo, Kenya, Sudan and Mali.</summary>